1
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:51,000
The Better Angels is a drama, history film directed by A.J. Edwards.

2
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:36,000
At an isolated log cabin in the harsh wilderness of Indiana circa 1817, the rhythms of love, tragedy, and the daily
hardships of life on the developing frontier shaped one of our nation’s greatest heroes: Abraham Lincoln.

3
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:21,000
Abe is a thoughtful and quiet boy who spends his days at the side of his beloved
mother while learning to work the land from his stern father.

4
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:06,000
When illness takes his mother, Abe's new guardian angel comes in the form of his new
stepmother, who sees the potential in the boy and pushes for his further education.

5
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:51,000
Sarah Lincoln, played by Diane Kruger.

6
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:36,000
Tom Lincoln, played by Jason Clarke.

7
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:21,000
Nancy Lincoln, played by Brit Marling.

8
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:06,000
Mr. Crawford, played by Wes Bentley.

9
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:51,000
Abraham Lincoln, played by Braydon Denney.

10
00:47:30,000 --> 00:47:36,000
Dennis, played by Cameron Mitchell Williams.

11
00:52:15,000 --> 00:52:21,000
The Better Angels is a 2014 American biographical historical drama film about
United States President Abraham Lincoln's formative years.

12
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:06,000
It was written and directed by A.

13
01:01:45,000 --> 01:01:51,000
Edwards and produced by Terrence Malick.

14
01:06:30,000 --> 01:06:36,000
The film had its premiere at 2014 Sundance Film Festival on January 18, 2014.

15
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:21,000
It was subsequently screened in the Panorama program at the 64th
Berlin International Film Festival on February 8, 2014.

16
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
In March 2014, Amplify acquired distribution rights to the film.

17
01:20:45,000 --> 01:20:51,000
It was released on November 7, 2014.

18
01:25:30,000 --> 01:25:36,000
The film explores themes of indiana, usa,
wilderness, education, biography, stepmother.

19
01:30:15,000 --> 01:30:21,000
The tone is emotional.
